ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"抵滁阳闻拱辰石太仆将至留赠 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"琅琊山色四时妍，最喜清流号酿泉。\n前辈风流今又见，使君刚及醉翁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42728,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次严太保诗后送尤介夫入都","author":"王世贞","text":"山人不爱青山住，乞得山中宰相诗。\n若遇郗家公子问，住山须待买山赀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42729,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠宪美弟移居","author":"王世贞","text":"岳王市傍三亩宫，曲曲清溪䆉稏风。\n但使儿童如锦里，不须名姓学墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42730,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐长孺及郁子以制科业见访有答 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"宛转双龙血未干，闲逢老马步阑残。\n莫夸玉勒金羁事，见说人间行路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42731,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐长孺及郁子以制科业见访有答 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"休将深浅问蛾眉，欲答蛾眉泪已垂。\n花样三千宫女面，何人不妒奉恩时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42732,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花下得刘伯真廷尉书却寄 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"万里清江万里鱼，即看鱼尾定何如。\n江南二月梅花后，剖得夷陵八月书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42733,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花下得刘伯真廷尉书却寄 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"小苑红梅刺眼新，一枝分作峡江春。\n长安驿骑知何限，天上于今少故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42734,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日偶尔有感 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"宛宛东风扬酒旗，轻寒轻暖禁烟时。\n千条杨柳长垂地，不晓人间有别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42735,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日偶尔有感 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"典衣沽酒莫辞贫，野鸟山花无限情。\n三尺一堆犹自湿，去年人是上坟人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42736,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后山园","author":"王世贞","text":"潺湲一雨到天明，西圃小溪春涨平。\n任使桃花禁不得，也能波面皱红生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42737,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐客部元春奉使还朝四绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"锦里春深节暂停，东风吹送上江舲。\n不知汉省郎官宿，分得荀家第几星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42738,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐客部元春奉使还朝四绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"还从建礼别分台，知尔应多专对才。\n属国倘逢西极马，可应仍为太师来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42739,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐客部元春奉使还朝四绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"凤毛池上独翩翩，知是虞廷老凤传。\n任使罢巢阿阁后，还鸣圣瑞一千年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42740,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐客部元春奉使还朝四绝句 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"青袍柳色竞争春，夹路珠帘看眼新。\n共道德门无限好，徐郎天上石麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42741,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为人赠京口何医一绝句","author":"王世贞","text":"君家肯让汉淳于，能使人间癖疾苏。\n不知京口观涛日，曾见黄龙浴水无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42742,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠八十翁何中翰迁故世庙侍臣也 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"炼来仙骨五铢轻，鹤背何年上太清。\n知是玉皇香案吏，可能还记步虚声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":42743,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]